This repository contains source code, documentation, coursework artifacts, and
prototype infrastructure references for the FlexShare ride-sharing platform.

Third-party dependencies are managed by the package manifests in each module,
including but not limited to:

- Front end: npm packages declared in `web/package.json`.
- Backend: Maven dependencies declared in `backend/pom.xml`
  and `backend/member-service/pom.xml`.
- Cloud prototypes: npm/Python dependencies and AWS service integrations under
  `cloud-prototypes/`.

Each third-party dependency remains governed by its own license. Before using
this project in production or redistributing a packaged build, review generated
dependency license reports and cloud provider terms separately.

The FlexShare name, project documents, diagrams, screenshots, demo videos, and
coursework submission materials are included for project review and attribution.
